member.remarks:
Note: It is often desirable to remove  when using
 but otherwise use defaults.

.WriteTo.OpenTelemetry(options =>
{
    options.IncludedData = (options.IncludedData | IncludedData.TemplateBody) & ~IncludedData.MessageTemplateTextAttribute;
})

member.summary:
A custom HTTP message handler. To suppress tracing of HTTP requests from the sink, set the handler to
a SocketsHttpHandler with null ActivityHeadersPropagator:

options.HttpMessageHandler = new SocketsHttpHandler { ActivityHeadersPropagator = null };
